<view class="safe-page ui2-page getting-page" role="main" aria-label="三步开始">
  <view class="intro-block">
    <text class="intro-title">从一件具体小事开始</text>
    <text class="intro-text">把一次亲子冲突写成一个小片段，看看反馈里的线索，再挑一个今天能做的小动作。</text>
    <text class="intro-text">也可以先“测一测”了解自己，大约 5 分钟；没时间写的话，在首页点一下“情绪温度计”记下此刻的感受。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="before-start" aria-label="开始前的说明与保护入口">
    <text class="before-start-title">开始前，先了解</text>
    <text class="before-start-copy">查看说明不会自动记录同意；涉及具体用途时，你仍需单独作出选择。</text>
    <navigator class="before-start-link" url="/pages/settings-detail/index?type=consent">知情与边界 <text aria-hidden="true">›</text></navigator>
    <navigator class="before-start-link" url="/pages/settings-detail/index?type=privacy">隐私说明 <text aria-hidden="true">›</text></navigator>
    <navigator class="before-start-link" url="/pages/settings-detail/index?type=protection">参与者保护 <text aria-hidden="true">›</text></navigator>
  </view>

  <view class="practice-list">
    <view class="practice-step">
      <text class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</text>
      <view class="step-content">
        <text class="step-title">写一个片段</text>
        <text class="step-text">{{exerciseSteps[0].text}}</text>
        <view class="reason-list">
          <view wx:for="{{eventReasons}}" wx:key="*this" class="reason-row">
            <text class="reason-dot" aria-hidden="true">•</text>
            <text class="reason-text">{{item}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="practice-step">
      <text class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</text>
      <view class="step-content">
        <text class="step-title">看反馈，标一个位置</text>
        <text class="step-text">{{exerciseSteps[1].text}}</text>
        <text class="arc-intro">保存后先看支持性反馈，再对照以下七个位置梳理发生的全过程：</text>
        <view class="arc-chain" role="list" aria-label="情绪反射弧七个位置">
          <view wx:for="{{arcNodes}}" wx:key="*this" class="arc-row" role="listitem">
            <text class="arc-index">{{index + 1}}</text>
            <text class="arc-node">{{item}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="practice-step practice-step-last">
      <text class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">03</text>
      <view class="step-content">
        <text class="step-title">做一个动作</text>
        <text class="step-text">{{exerciseSteps[2].text}}</text>
        <text class="step-route">记录一次 → 查看反馈线索 → 去训练中心练一个小动作</text>
        <text class="step-text">训练中心里还有三个分节书写的练习项目，适合想多练几次的时候。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="boundary-block" aria-label="使用边界">
    <text class="boundary-title">使用边界</text>
    <view wx:for="{{boundaries}}" wx:key="*this" class="boundary-row">
      <text class="boundary-dot" aria-hidden="true">•</text>
      <text class="boundary-text">{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="action-row">
    <button class="safe-primary-button primary-action" bindtap="startDiary">记录一次</button>
    <button class="safe-outline-button secondary-action" bindtap="openAssessment">先测一测</button>
    <button class="safe-outline-button secondary-action" bindtap="openTraining">去训练中心</button>
  </view>

  <view class="before-start" aria-label="需要帮助时">
    <text class="before-start-title">需要帮助时</text>
    <navigator class="before-start-link" url="/pages/emergency-resources/index">查看求助资源 <text aria-hidden="true">›</text></navigator>
    <navigator class="before-start-link" url="/pages/supervision/index">提交人工支持请求 <text aria-hidden="true">›</text></navigator>
  </view>
</view>
